{"reviews":[{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-0","r":1.0,"t":"Not what I expected","x":"Well it didn\u2019t have the instructions in English so I didn\u2019t really know how to use it, how to prepare my skin or how long to leave it on. Also it definitely didn\u2019t do what the add shows. I would love to get those directions in English.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-1","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"If there was 0 to rate this product I would give it to it. Waste of money! Do not buy it is worthless there\u2019s not work and everything the shows in the pictures and the video is a BS.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-2","r":1.0,"t":"Doesnt work like the ads, not worth the buy","x":"It doesnt work like the videos on the facebook ads. Its just a simple mask. If i was looking for that, id just go to the store. Only thing i do like is its easier to put on without getting my hands messy.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-3","r":3.0,"t":"Good","x":"Helps clear skin.  Doesn't work magic in one use, but it does work after a few applications.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-4","r":1.0,"t":"Bad is not working for me","x":"So bad I get a bad result, my skin get red and like on fired!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-5","r":1.0,"t":"Save your money. Don\u2019t buy","x":"Don\u2019t waste your money  Dried my oily skin in one use  Couldn\u2019t even keep on my face for 10 minutes it was harsh/burning  My skin was finally clear prior. I shouldn\u2019t have Used it. It caused me to break out.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-6","r":2.0,"t":"Tbh just not worth the price","x":"Made my face break out more (yes it could just be my skin) but it left my skin feeling super oily and not any more clear then any other clenser/mask ive tried I honestly wouldnt buy it again unless it was like at dollar tree or only a couple $$ for a stick (i got it at like $13 for the both -so roughly $7 a peice - if they where $3 a peice maybe but not at $7) Would i use it again - yea cause i have it ill try it a fuew more times maybe - im just ganna have to wash my face again after using it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-7","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn't work at all","x":"Got this to try it out. Not only did it not help with blackheads. It made my skin and my husbands skin break out. I had zits worse then when I was a teen. That video is 100% fact they must be rudding tea into it, to make it look like something happened then then use a editor to smooth the skin or something. Cause it was just the worst thing I ever used.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-8","r":1.0,"t":"Not true to its ads/videos","x":"Absolutely TERRIBLE! I was genuinely so excited to try this, I had seen it for months. Bought it and NOTHING happened. The mask didn\u2019t pull anything out it. I left it on longer to see if that would help, it didn\u2019t. My skin started to feel warm, like just before it starts burning. The lowest star is 1, if it was up to me it would have 0.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-9","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use","x":"I like that you don't have to use your hands to put this on. The sides do get alittle messy when using but not to bad. I do face masks at least once every 2 weeks and love the way my face feels after. I will be ordering more when mine are empty.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-10","r":1.0,"t":"Product come without instructions","x":"This product came without instructions. Therefore, I used it like I saw in a video and it didn't  work. So I left it on for about 30 mins  longer thinking maybe it need to set and it still didn't work like the advertised video. Waste of money!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-11","r":4.0,"t":"Convenient and decent product","x":"This product is great as a small convenient face mask. It is quite dry and chalky once it\u2019s set and I wouldn\u2019t say it\u2019s a very deep cleanse, but in terms of convenience you can\u2019t beat it! Perfect for on the go, travel, or slumber parties:)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-12","r":1.0,"t":"No Results","x":"ello to whom this Product Corresponds. I am Disappointed in this Product. I used it 3 times and there were no results as stated by the company for this product. Just Spend and My Wasted Time. Please don't fool the People. Thanks","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-13","r":3.0,"t":"hands free way to apply basic mask.great travel size.Don\u2019t expect it to work like the videos.","x":"Obviously didn\u2019t work like it does on videos, but not surprised by that. It goes on smooth and dries like like chalk. Make sure you have a go to moisturizer. Great travel size.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-14","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t believe the ad","x":"I used it to clean my face, so the TRUTH is - it didn\u2019t work at all. No help with black heads, no clean face. It is really disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-15","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste ur money on these !!!!","x":"It doesn\u2019t so what it\u2019s says it does money wasted !!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-16","r":1.0,"t":"Nothing like the video","x":"I thought I was getting the same size product featured in the video. Nope. Maybe half the size. First disappointment. Second the results in the video look impressive. The reality is not even close. I do have blackheads and guess what? I still have blackheads. Lesson learned not everyone has truth in advertising. Disappointed in a big way.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-17","r":1.0,"t":"Buyer beware","x":"\"Tiktok made me do it\". I had been seeing these products advertised all over tiktok and was amazed at the results. But of course it didn't give me the results shown on the videos I had seen. Nothing about this product was like why was advertised. I was disappointed","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-18","r":1.0,"t":"Just dried my skin out, didn't feel any positive effects","x":"No directions came with it, and all it did was dry my skin out and made me feel itchy afterwards. No noticeable difference in clearing up acne, or my complexion. Doesn't even remotely mimic the video on the product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-19","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work at all","x":"Got this because my teen daughter is fighting an acne phase and we tried it together but no luck.  This did nothing for our face not even as much as a normal face mask. Very disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-20","r":2.0,"t":"Okay but not like ads","x":"The ads show the user rolling it on their face. It is way too soft and crumbly to do that! My face felt soft the next day but not cleaner amd it removed zero blackheads.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-21","r":1.0,"t":"False advertising!!!","x":"Does not work at all. Waste of time and money. No instructions on how to use. Leaves a lingering smell on skin after washed off. Would give zero stars if possible.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-22","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy this crap it don\u2019t work. The video is hyped for you buy.","x":"Had this thing on my face for 20mins it didn\u2019t do what the video say and what the add say it was a waste of money don\u2019t waste your money on this product please.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-23","r":4.0,"t":"it work for the most part","x":"I got this mask because of the review it had and the video show results, It didn't work as I though it will, but my face did felt smooth after using it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08T6WNDLB-24","r":1.0,"t":"Scam product","x":"This product did nothing like advertised. It irritated and broke out my skin more than it helped. Save your money total scam product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the product does not work as shown in the 